  message: "Campaign 5 done, 2026-11-18 20:23Z, dev 55e2fbb2c, seed 20261120. 83 planted, 47 ran, 42 failed a test (12,801 failed tests; 12,083 kept, 440 named). ZERO REAL MISSES. 278 outside, all from one fault (linkers/registry.py::clear_registry drop call, a test-only cleanup): all 278 pass alone with the fault (replay_misses.py, 278 passed in 53.7 s); registry tests then two victim files at -n 0 give 44 failed with the fault, 127 passed clean, so they fail through the leaked registry. Every one of the 42 failing runs had a failure inside the selection; 35 of them were narrowed. 0 in 42 bounds the per-run miss rate below about 7% (95%), not at zero. The cleanup gap is filed as WI-kihah. Summary: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/bar/campaign5_summary.txt. WI-pugol may proceed."  # 9cc9
